{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "THE GENERAL SAGA",
    "steam_appid": 3211290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own millennium. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JRPG-style survivor action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Survive by collecting dot characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a survivor action game with JRPG-style dot characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one general from a variety of professions and gather your friends to make up your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your party with equipment items and special techniques to survive for the full time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Form a formation and meet the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where should the collected characters be placed and in which direction should they attack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your own unique formations to face the myriad of enemies that are closing in on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formations can be freely changed at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Let's make history that spans a thousand years!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, the outcome is recorded in the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events are recorded according to the results of the war, creating your own personal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you to decide how the 1000-year battle will end in a multi-ending system.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own millennium. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JRPG-style survivor action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Survive by collecting dot characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a survivor action game with JRPG-style dot characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one general from a variety of professions and gather your friends to make up your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your party with equipment items and special techniques to survive for the full time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Form a formation and meet the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where should the collected characters be placed and in which direction should they attack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your own unique formations to face the myriad of enemies that are closing in on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formations can be freely changed at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Let's make history that spans a thousand years!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, the outcome is recorded in the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events are recorded according to the results of the war, creating your own personal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you to decide how the 1000-year battle will end in a multi-ending system.</p>",
